{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43619","headline":"项王古祠联句 · 清昼","name":"项王古祠联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遗庙风尘积，荒途岁月侵。\n英灵今寂寞，容卫尚森沈。\n霸楚志何在，平秦功亦深。\n诸侯归复背，青史古将今。\n星聚分已定，天亡力岂任。\n采蘩如可荐，举酒沥空林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清昼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43619.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43619","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}